title: faa-aircraft-registry-mcp-server
abstract: "Decode N-numbers to aircraft, engine, status, and owner, and search the US civil aircraft registry (FAA Releasable Aircraft Database) by owner, type, or state — offline and keyless over an embedded SQLite + FTS5 mirror, with fail-safe owner-PII redaction."
type: software
authors:
